# Self-tests that scripts/ci/self-tests.py does not run on a hosted runner, one path per line, `#` and the reason after it.
# Reason classes: ARGS (a checker called by a build with its inputs, not a standalone test), SUITE (run by another test),
# INPUT (needs build output, a local checkout or a backup a runner does not have), HEADER (its header's build line names
# generated inputs), KNOWN-FAIL (fails on main as of the commit named; an open item, to be fixed and taken off this list).
firmware/selector/test/test-selector-bin.py            # ARGS: checks a built selector (OBJ BIN), called by firmware/selector/Makefile
tooling/switch/test-pack-selector.py                   # ARGS: takes the selector binary built by tooling/switch/run-tests.sh
tooling/switch/test-bootflag-sh.sh                     # SUITE: tooling/switch/run-tests.sh
tooling/switch/test-sign-props.sh                      # SUITE: tooling/switch/run-tests.sh
